<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:23:07 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>库里蒂巴中心</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96edd5a213a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;库里蒂巴市中心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Centro de Curitiba" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a96edd5a213a.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:23:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>海浪</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96d4570f8b4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;海浪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Waves" height="1080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6a96d4570f8b4.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:34:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>铁轨延伸向远方，上方是湛蓝的天空和蓬松的白云，两旁是茂密的绿树和公寓楼群。</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96c2b75e26b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;铁轨延伸向远方，上方是湛蓝的天空和蓬松的白云，两旁是茂密的绿树和公寓楼群。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Train tracks leading into the distance under a bright blue sky with fluffy white clouds, bordered by lush green trees and apartment buildings. - Bahngeleise, die sich unter einem strahlend blauen Himmel mit flauschigen weißen Wolken in die Ferne erstrecken, gesäumt von üppigen grünen Bäumen und Mehrfamilienhäusern." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a96c2b75e26b.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 12:19:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>lol，早上好！</title><link>https://some.pics/6a966e4b8bf46</link><description>&lt;p&gt;lol，早上好！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="lol, goeiemorgen!" height="3937" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a966e4b8bf46.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 06:18:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>沙科皮风景步道</title><link>https://some.pics/6a96476b533b4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;沙科皮市（明尼苏达州）塔帕至风景区高地排水通道步道&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A paved path extends into the golden light of a sunset, bordered by green grassy hills and trees." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6a96476b533b4.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 03:33:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>窗边比心</title><link>https://some.pics/6a95f6be7c0fd</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🪟🫳🏻❤️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small black and white dog stands on her hind legs at a window so the hand reaching in can scratch her head." height="2448" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jinx/6a95f6be7c0fd.jpg" width="3264"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jinx.some.pics"&gt;@jinx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:48:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巧柜山核桃心口袋件</title><link>https://some.pics/6a95ad376b42b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;巧思柜：山胡桃木心口袋小件。

完整配方：https://cunningneighborlady.com/2026/08/cunning-cabinet-hickory-heart-pocket-piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small red cotton charm packet beside an intact dry hickory nut and a clean broad iron washer on plain weathered wood, with the finished knotted packet resting near the heel of a practical leather shoe." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/cunningneighborlady/6a95ad376b42b.png" width="1536"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://cunningneighborlady.some.pics"&gt;@cunningneighborlady&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:35:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>红车黑盔停于红果旁</title><link>https://some.pics/6a958d1c83411</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一辆红色自行车停在鹅卵石人行道上，车把上放着一个黑色头盔，旁边是木栅栏和一栋建筑，建筑旁有一丛结着红色浆果的灌木。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A red bike with a black helmet resting on the handlebars is parked on a cobblestone sidewalk next to a wooden fence and a building with a bush bearing red berries. - Ein rotes Bike mit einem schwarzen Helm auf dem Lenker ist auf einem Kopfsteinpflaster-Gehweg neben einem Holzzaun und einem Gebäude mit einem Strauch mit roten Beeren geparkt." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a958d1c83411.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:18:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>西班牙建筑图案</title><link>https://some.pics/6a95813902dc2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;建筑图案，西班牙托雷莫利诺斯（2026年）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Building pattern, Torremolinos, Spain (2026)" height="5184" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hiddenflair/6a95813902dc2.jpg" width="3888"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hiddenflair.some.pics"&gt;@hiddenflair&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 13:27:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a94b1792d8ff</link><description>&lt;p&gt;游泳区域绳索系在码头上的位置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Wooden dock with rope and orange buoy floating on dark water." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6a94b1792d8ff.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 22:41:01 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>